    "answer": {
      "short": "${}^{12}C_{6}\\times{}^{6}C_{4}\\times{}^{2}C_{2}=13\\,860$",
      "worked": "Choose six people for the table for six, four of the remaining six for the table for four, and the remaining two for the table for two:\n$$\\begin{aligned}N&={}^{12}C_{6}\\times{}^{6}C_{4}\\times{}^{2}C_{2}\\\\N&=924\\times15\\times1\\\\N&=13\\,860.\\end{aligned}$$",
